---
layout: broadcast.njk
title: Updates
description: Latest updates, game recaps, and academic milestones from Kevin Franz Jr., Class of 2028 student-athlete.
permalink: /updates/
active: updates
---

<section style="padding:80px 56px 56px; background:var(--b-bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:24px;">&bull; UPDATES</div>
  <h1 class="b-upd-h1" style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:150px; line-height:0.85; letter-spacing:-0.045em; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0; color:var(--b-text);">
    Latest<br><span style="-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--b-green-bright); -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">news.</span>
  </h1>
  <p style="font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:32px; max-width:620px;">
    Game recaps, academic milestones, and what's on my mind.
  </p>
</section>

{% set posts = collections.updates %}
{% if posts | length %}
<section class="b-grid b-grid-2 b-grid-bordered">
  {% for post in posts %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="background:var(--b-bg); padding:36px 32px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--b-text); display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-height:240px;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:16px;">
        <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase;">{{ post.data.type or 'UPDATE' }}</div>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:var(--b-mute); text-transform:uppercase; white-space:nowrap;">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:26px; line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-0.02em; text-transform:uppercase; margin:16px 0 12px;">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--b-mute); margin:0; flex:1;">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:20px;">READ MORE &rarr;</span>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% else %}
<section style="padding:64px 56px; background:var(--b-bg);">
  <p style="color:var(--b-mute); font-size:16px;">No updates yet &mdash; check back soon.</p>
</section>
{% endif %}
